[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_BENEATH_THE_PACT]
Beneath the Pact

[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_BENEATH_THE_PACT_desc]
The Canterlot Pact has set the peace order of this new world, but beneath the order of the pact, countless conspiracies and tricks in the shadow can brew without restraint.

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_BENEATH_THE_PACT]
协定之下

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_BENEATH_THE_PACT_desc]
坎特洛特协定划定了这个新世界的和平秩序，但在协定的秩序之下，阴影中的无数阴谋与诡计，却可以不受约束地酝酿。
